#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.kget.appdata.xml:14
msgid "Downloading files from FTP and HTTP(S) sources."
msgstr "Descarga de ficheros dende oríxenes FTP, HTTP y HTTPS."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.kget.appdata.xml:15
msgid ""
"Pausing and resuming of downloading files, as well as the ability to restart "
"a download."
msgstr ""
"Posa y sigue colos ficheros de descarga, amás de poder reaniciar les "
"descargues."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.kget.appdata.xml:16
msgid "Tells lots of information about current and pending downloads."
msgstr "Diz muncha información tocante a les descargues actuales y pendientes."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.kget.appdata.xml:17
msgid "Embedding into system tray."
msgstr "Incrustación na bandexa del sistema."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.kget.appdata.xml:18
msgid "Integration with the Konqueror web browser."
msgstr "Integración col restolador web Konqueror."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.kget.appdata.xml:19
msgid ""
"Metalink support which contain multiple URLs for downloads, along with "
"checksums and other information."
msgstr ""
"Sofitu pa metaenllaces que contienen munches URLs pa descargues, xunto coles "
"sumes de comprobación y otra información."

